# The context of the image of hive-portal, built from the root of the monorepo (docker build -f portal/Dockerfile .).
# BuildKit reads this file instead of the root's .dockerignore. Nothing goes in by default; only what the Dockerfile
# copies.
**

!portal/requirements.lock
!portal/src/
!shared/

# And of that, never what is not code.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/config.env
**/*.env
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
